      "op": "note",
      "text": "充能冷却改口径(2026-09-25 用户裁决):拥有充能时把**基础值**封顶 —— 立牌主动 180 秒→160 秒(3600→3200 tick)、效果牌 30 秒→20 秒(600→400 tick);之后诡异骰子 -50% 照旧(有充能时 1600 tick);**已在进行的倒计时不得被改动**(cardEndSame=1)。capSign/capCard 直读共享库常量。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe chargeset CC0 0"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe chargeset CC1 5"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe chargecd CC2"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot dice \"astral_dice:weird_dice\" CCW"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
